WEBVTT

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:21.250
Huh? Um... What?!

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.290
Wh-What was that for?!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.760
So... the rumors were true.

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:31.430
Rumors?

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.350
That you lost your memories.

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.680
Yeah, Chinu-<i>san</i>! That's why
your kiss shocked me!

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.310
You know my name?

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:42.480
Well, I saw you in a magazine.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.230
I see.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.150
Hmm?

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:48.320
Were we like "that"?

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.360
"That"?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.950
I take it we had something
special going on?

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:58.000
If so, I probably dropped the "-<i>san</i>"
from your name, right?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.750
Do I dare say it?

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:05.840
Chinu... Chinu... Chinu... Chinu--

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.840
Um, in your dreams.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:06.630
Huh?

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.970
I hardly know you.
It's our third time talking.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:11.010
Huh?

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:15.890
The first time was in 9th grade
at a spring event.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:21.020
You dropped your chamois towel.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:24.400
When I said, "Hey, your shammy"...

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.230
...you said, "Oh, thanks."

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.400
That was it.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.860
Uh...

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.160
The second time was over there.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:33.990
Huh?

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.240
That summer, you came to my school...

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.960
You said, "I liked you ever since,"
and sorta confessed.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.500
"Sorta"?

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.540
But when I refused, you said:

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.260
"When I'm Japan's best water
polo player, you owe me a kiss."

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:56.300
That sounds like something
I might've said.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:02.270
And, "I'll pay you 110,000 yen if I fail,"
so I agreed to shut you up.

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:07.480
Argh, I'm the worst!
What a weird number--110,000.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.900
It's "plus tax."

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.650
Sounds like me.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:16.950
So, since you won the Momotaro Cup,
I kept my part of the promise.

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.120
I see.

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.540
Isn't that Yamanami's uniform?

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:23.330
Hmm?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.000
Why? Their team isn't strong.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.130
I'm not playing. It's close to home.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.130
You're not playing?!

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:35.300
For starters, I don't even
remember the rules!

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.850
It's hopeless for me.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.390
Huh?

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:43.850
Then, I guess I won the bet.

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.270
Huh?

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:51.400
An accident? Here I thought he
was too dumb for high school.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.110
Not quite.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.320
So that's why he won't play?!

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.780
Seems to be.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:02.490
Oh my god! And he was my star of hope!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:09.790
Unfortunately, I think he's stepping away
from water polo for good... Huh?

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.210
Hmm? He's coming this way.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.800
I'll join!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.920
What'd he say?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.260
I'll join!

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:18.220
Huh?

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.260
What?!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.770
I'll join the water polo club!

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.100
Eh?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:02.690
Episode 2              I'm No Prodigy

