00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.870
Then, I guess I won the bet.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.540
You don't remember the other half?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.040
The other half?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.630
"If I'm Japan's best in high school,
you've gotta date me."

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:17.630
Huh?!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:23.930
And when I refused, you said,
"I'll pay you 220,000 yen if I'm not."

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.260
That bet doesn't hold up!

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:30.730
Huh? I kissed you! I held up my end!

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:34.770
There's no way I could pull that off now!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:39.110
Since when were you this pathetic?

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.570
Uh...

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:43.780
You didn't used to be like this.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.950
You disappoint me. Goodbye.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.660
Uh, fine!

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:51.960
I'll pay up!

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.920
Unbelievable!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:53.920
Huh?

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:57.710
Start playing water polo again!
Why give up?

00:05:57.710 --> 00:05:59.630
C'mon! "Japan's best"?

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.840
Then, Okayama's best.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.090
Still...

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.720
Then, dish out the money!

