00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.390
Guess I've gotta.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:19.940
I started by telling my family
I was picking up water polo again.

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:23.450
That made it so I couldn't quit on a whim.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:26.950
No need to force yourself.
Don't do it for us.

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:32.450
I'm totally not. It's because...
water polo is calling me.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.500
Rather, it's got me by the wallet.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.670
Oh, really?

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:39.460
That's my dumb brother.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.260
Hey!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:45.930
But... I know you'll work hard, Big Bro.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.600
Yup!

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:59.980
If everyone's this happy,
I'm glad I decided to start.

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:07.990
Having said that, how does one
work hard at water polo?

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:11.700
Swimming? Lifting? Or something else--?

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.200
There he is!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.290
Hmm?

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.710
Kiyomizu, you're a star!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:18.460
Hey, prodigy!

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:20.380
Huh? What?

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:23.260
These were on our desks.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:33.300
"Hey Dudes!!"

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:29.140
"If you wanna go to Nationals,
join the water polo club.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:35.810
We've got Minato Kiyomizu,
who was #1 in Japan during junior high.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:40.270
With him, we'll make it to Nationals.
Don't miss this chance.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:45.030
See you at the pool.
Water Polo Captain, Jo Jojima."

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:45.980
"Here!"
"Water Polo Club!!"

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.740
What the hell?!

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.040
Hey, blondie boy!

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.790
You scared me!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:02.090
Can you not distribute these?
It's annoying.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:04.880
C'mon, man! You're our ace!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:08.380
I'm not an ace. And it's annoying
that you're calling--

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:15.180
There he is! The one on the right
is the prodigy, Minato!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:16.680
About that--

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:22.360
Gentlemen! Welcome to the
future-water-polo-champions club!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.610
Let's work hard with our prodigy, Minato!

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.070
Yeah!

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.570
Cut it out!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.950
Huh?

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:34.240
I'm no prodigy.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:42.380
I might've been before, but my
muscles atrophied from the accident

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:46.340
and I can't even remember playing it.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:50.510
Everyone's high expectations
are tough on me.

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:54.720
So... can you not get your hopes up?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:57.980
Lame.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.020
Bummer.

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:01.770
Then I'm out.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:02.730
Me, too!

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:04.060
No point.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:04.690
Yeah.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:05.480
Uh...

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.900
H-Hey, wait!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.450
I'm sorry.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:18.750
I tried to get members without
considering your feelings.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:24.630
It's okay. But since everyone left,
what's the plan now?

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.130
Not everyone.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:26.790
Huh?

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.010
See?

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:33.890
Whoa! You guys stayed behind!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.680
You're huge!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:43.060
I'm Class 1-A, Yutaka Babayaro Inomata.
My dad's Nigerian.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:46.270
I kinda got dragged along.

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:51.740
Your words inspired me to join.

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:55.820
Huh? What words?
I said something inspirational?

00:09:55.820 --> 00:10:01.540
"The dough's fermenting.
You gotta wait for it to rise."

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.370
Huh?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.000
Huh?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.210
I'm quoting a pâtissier.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.800
Yeah?

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:12.050
Why quote a pâtissier? What a mystery.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.680
...to meet you.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:23.350
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Nobody even heard you talk!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.940
In a louder voice, please!

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:30.400
Class 1-C, Yoshiharu Ushimado.
My dad's Japanese. Nice to meet you.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.110
Do we need to know about dads?

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:34.780
Why join water polo?

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.950
Just... because.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:37.830
That's it?

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.200
If that's bad, I'll go.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.830
Wait, wait, wait!

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:43.160
Yet another mysterious guy!

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:47.840
Just forget it, Captain.
I know! Show us the pool!

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:50.840
Good idea! C'mon, let's go!

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:51.760
Okay!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:54.260
Pool! Pool! Pool!

