00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:02.140
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:07.900
Behold! Here's our
magnificent playing field!

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:12.740
Huh?

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.490
Where is it?

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:24.290
Apparently, the pool was once used for
classes, but it got old and forgotten.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:29.920
Since it was deep, some students
wanted to use it for water polo,

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:30.000
Principal's Office

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:30.000
Principal

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.130
so they got the school's
permission to use it.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:33.250
Water Polo Club

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.800
But being outside,
it's cold for most the year.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:41.220
So they laid out a blue cover
to keep the water warm.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:45.430
They also built a little
shack with a bath.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:49.810
Even when it's cold,
they train by wearing wet suits.

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:52.980
Or so blondie boy says.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.990
Is everyone still with me?

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:57.400
--Yeah.
--Mmm.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.620
Water polo sounds rough.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.950
I've never heard of a pool like this.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:10.630
When I started school here last year,
the club had been disbanded for 10 years!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:11.790
Hmm?

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.710
In other words,
I'm the one who revived it!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.300
Play water polo! It's fun!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.300
It was pretty rough.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.970
I asked everyone in sight.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:20.970
Um... Please! Please!

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:25.310
Somehow, I got the seven people
needed to restart the club.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:25.310
Yeah! Let's do this, guys!

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:29.230
Thing is, none of them
really got into it

00:12:25.310 --> 00:12:29.230
If we're gonna do this, let's aim
to be the best in Japan! The best!

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.440
and they quit in a flash.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.770
"Resignation" "I quit"
"I can't keep up. I quit." "I'm out."

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:35.280
Soon enough, it was only me.

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:42.450
Since I couldn't compete, I kept the
pool clean and trained all by myself.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:43.530
Huh?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:48.620
And I did it 'cuz I believed that
new members would come!

