00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.170
Then you guys joined! Thank you!

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:56.800
Um! Sorry to spoil the moment.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:57.590
Huh?

00:12:57.590 --> 00:13:00.340
Are you the only upperclassmen?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.260
Yup.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.930
So, this is everyone?

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:03.800
Yup.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.680
Water polo takes seven?

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.600
Yup.

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.970
We're short.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:08.560
Yup.

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:13.440
What do you mean, "Yup"?!
We don't have enough to play!

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:14.730
Yup.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.530
Oy!

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:19.400
Now I need a job for that 220,000!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.950
Sounds cool!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.660
Huh?

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:28.620
If joining means you're a regular,
it's got that minor sport vibe!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:33.830
I was just passing by.
The name's Takekazu Ejiri. Count me in!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:38.510
Woo! Here's our sixth! Come on in!

00:13:38.510 --> 00:13:44.340
Oh, man! He looks like a troublemaker.
Do they normally play sports?

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.140
Captain! Can I make a request?

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.180
Hell yeah! What's up?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:54.400
I wanna play keeper. We'll never lose
if no one scores on us.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:58.610
Sorry, I'm our keeper.
Pick another position.

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:02.070
Huh? Who decided on that?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:07.080
Well, it kinda was the only thing
I could train on my own.

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:11.000
In other words, you gave
yourself the position, pal.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.290
"Pal"?

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:16.250
This ain't right.
I might be better than you.

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.090
Oh, yeah?

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:20.880
Let's compete with PKs.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.550
Huh?

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:25.930
Oh?! What now?

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:28.180
Huh? How should I know?!

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:30.930
Have you played water polo?

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:35.650
Nope. But with my talent, it'll be easy.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.360
Listen here. Water--

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.400
Don't underestimate water polo!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:46.280
Okay! We'll have a contest! Right, Senpai?

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.620
Who made you boss?!

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:52.790
It'll be fine! Show us your
skills and kick his butt!

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:54.500
Don't pressure me!

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.210
Minato here can take the shots.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.090
Huh?!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:01.090
We need the same shooter so it's fair.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:04.680
But me, shooting?

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:08.050
You haven't been in the water yet, right?

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.640
Your body might remember once you're in.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:20.150
All right.

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.440
Mmm.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:30.990
His body makes the cut.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:35.660
We've really gotta wear
these dorky things?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.630
It's either that or you can't play.

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:40.460
Yeah, yeah.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.760
He's ripped.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:52.350
I used to be seriously into baseball.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.600
These hats don't fit very well.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.560
It's on backward!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.690
Huh? Really?

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:06.900
Was his body always this slender?

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.360
All right.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:15.330
What if my memory really comes back?

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.790
--Huh?
--What?

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:37.850
Whoa! This feeling...!

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.400
Brr!

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:42.940
Don't go jumping in! It's dangerous!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.730
Sorry!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:49.950
The cold packs a punch this time of year.
Let's make this quick.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:52.120
Works for me.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:59.420
Ejiri goes first, and Captain, second.
We'll compete with sudden death.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:04.250
It's bigger and harder than I thought.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:09.010
All right, Minato-<i>senpai</i>!
Go ahead and throw!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:11.640
Huh? Oh, right.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:16.060
Even with that body,
I bet he's an awesome shot.

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:24.440
Uh...

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:26.480
Hell yeah!

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:31.530
That counts as me blocking, right?!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.410
Whatever.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:41.250
Huh? How am I supposed to throw?!
It's too deep to get footing!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:44.080
You've gotta eggbeater and jump!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.960
What's an eggbeater?!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.250
For real?

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.760
For real...?

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.760
Hurry up and throw! I'm freezing!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.090
Sorry!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:59.020
It's against the rules, but use
two hands to throw if that helps.

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:04.440
Two hands... All right.

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:05.810
Here goes!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.910
Nice arc!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.740
That's in!

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:25.080
Whoa!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.630
He wasn't kidding about training.

00:18:28.630 --> 00:18:31.510
I'd be scared to go up against him.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.880
Mmm.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:38.850
How do you jump that high in water?

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:41.810
That last shot might be trouble.

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:45.310
I know! If I move back...

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:46.810
Perfect!

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.440
In that case...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:58.990
Yes!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.620
Dammit.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.580
Why can't I sit on the bench?!

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:10.250
Unfortunately, there're lots
of players of your caliber.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:14.760
Even I wanna feel talented at something...

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:20.010
That's why I ditched baseball.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.430
Dammit!

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:26.650
Yeah! I did it! That felt great!

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:35.070
H-Huh? Is he hurt?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.740
He'll drown.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.430
He's fine. Just a leg cramp.

00:19:57.430 --> 00:19:59.300
Phew!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:03.850
I've never seen him in such a sad state.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:06.140
Sorry about that.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.850
Don't mention it.

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:11.270
But now we can't finish the PKs.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.860
It's over.

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:14.690
Huh?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:21.660
I can't jump like that in the water,
or kick off the wall like him.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:28.080
It's clear I won't win.
I've got no talent for water polo.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:34.170
I joined with ulterior motives.
I thought I'd be big in a minor sport.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:37.590
Sorry for underestimating water polo.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.550
I resign.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:41.390
Huh?

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:43.760
It was brief, but thank you.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:45.100
Too brief!

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:46.680
Peace out.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:49.020
Please, stay on!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.310
But--

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.400
I don't care about your motives!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:18.170
Please! I don't wanna have
to train alone again!

