00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:24.430
Help me actually play in a match! Please!

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:26.560
But--

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:31.850
Don't give up! It's your first time!
You might have talent for it!

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:38.900
If you leave, you'll miss out on seeing
something your talents could make.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.280
Hmm?

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.740
What's that?

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.280
A splash.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:51.580
Oh, man! He seriously made that joke?!

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.000
I'll stay.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.630
It hooked 'em!

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.710
Yeah!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:03.470
You can brag about stopping me
when I'm the best player, Captain!

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:04.470
Yeah!

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:08.220
Let's rock! Water polo, here I come!

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:11.190
But aren't we a person short?

00:22:11.190 --> 00:22:12.480
Oh, yeah...

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:17.780
Leave that to your captain!
I've got my eyes on someone.

00:22:17.780 --> 00:22:19.230
Oh?

00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:28.410
Shugo Amihama. Ranked 3rd in last
year's junior high 100-meter freestyle.

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:29.540
Ooh!

00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:33.120
Fast swimmers have
a big advantage in polo!

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.750
If he joins us, we'll be super strong!

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.960
Awesome!

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:40.760
But...

00:22:43.220 --> 00:22:46.510
It looks like he joined track.

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:47.970
Huh?
